                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' underline='true'>Note:</run>
                      <run>
1. the data is coming from Inventory Management
2. this data is showing last 60 stock quantity (taken by the end of the day) filtered for products that had a negative stock amount in the last 60 days
3. If today&apos;s stock is empty, then take the last available value as current stock
(e.g. if last value for SKU 124556 is shown on the 2020-10-18 as -5, and today is the 2020-10-24, then -5 also is the stock for 2020-10-24)</run>
                    </formatted-text>
